'' TKO0370 (RFC-0002 V12): the importer defines UNICODE (-d), which the module's public header
'' consulted and found undefined. Re-read here it would declare what the module never saw, so
'' the import is refused, at the '#import'.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -d UNICODE -i tests/modules/src/vpub/libs tests/modules/src/vpub/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/vendorpub0370.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: main.tiko(1,1): error TKO0370: 'unicode' is defined as '-1' here, but module 'vp.geo' read
'' EXPECT-OUT: with it undefined
